<title>FRANCE: BIC buys penmaker Sheaffer.</title>
<headline>BIC buys penmaker Sheaffer.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIC SA said in a statement its BIC Corp subsidiary had agreed to buy penmaker Sheaffer for an undisclosed amount. Sheaffer has annual sales of more than $50 million.</p>
</text>
